    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>The End of Infinite Return</i></strong> is a 2D dot game where you progress through the story, use firearms to defeat enemies, solve puzzles, and make choices at each branching point to see the corresponding ending. It is played in a top-down view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/1952cee0082316e400480e7b7b8d68e5.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Rookie Agent going on missions in a simulated world, Lexy performs\u00a0her duties faithfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/08d46b52c6910ffc4122382f0532d9e4.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, suspicious occurrences in her missions cause her to question\u00a0her own existence and the purpose of the simulation.\u00a0The moment she meets Olivia, her fate begins to change dramatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/9b97cef5169f78eb44d026b4d4276f87.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control Lexy to defeat enemies, quickly escape dangerous areas,\u00a0and carry out missions while discovering the secrets of the simulation and\u00a0confronting their own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/9965012101465b088923330b43c9769e.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/f2013ffa0e12333dedf7feefa1eba576.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lexy can acquire various firearms and ammunition through missions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your abilities with points earned by completing missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/46563d1025d48983d32b21f6f469f963.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various puzzles while completing missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/227e5da345662b0e126d88c6e25da8cb.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lexy must choose her own fate through branching points during gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/14f3b7c1d89f8c0dfb61d7767b39b00c.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, the choices made in determining her destiny result in varying\u00a0outcomes, creating multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435400/extras/f69668b303fb320b83ae4ed46dce2264.avif?t=1738142614\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
